sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>(Kubernetes)
    participant CMCtrl as ConfigMap Controller
    participant DS as Shared Datastore
    participant HPACtrl as HPA Controller
    participant IPCtrl as InferencePool Controller
    participant SOCtrl as ScaledObject Controller
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    participant Engine as Optimization Engine<br/>(Kalman + GPU Rebalance)
    participant Actuator as DirectActuator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS

    Note over CMCtrl,DS: Startup: Configuration Bootstrap
    CM->>CMCtrl: ConfigMap created/updated
    CMCtrl->>DS: Populate autoscaling parameters
    CMCtrl->>CMCtrl: Gate readiness until sync complete

    Note over HPACtrl,SOCtrl: Resource Discovery
    HPACtrl->>DS: Register HPA targets
    IPCtrl->>DS: Register InferencePool targets
    SOCtrl->>DS: Register ScaledObject targets (conditional)

    Note over Prom,Actuator: Scaling Loop
    loop Every reconciliation cycle
        Engine->>Prom: Query workload saturation metrics<br/>GET /api/v1/query<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Prom-->>Engine: Metric results (saturation signals)

        Engine->>K8s: GET Nodes (GPU capacity)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8s-->>Engine: Node resources & allocatable GPUs

        Engine->>K8s: GET ResourceQuotas<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8s-->>Engine: Quota limits

        Engine->>Engine: Kalman filter prediction
        Engine->>Engine: GPU rebalancing calculation
        Engine->>Actuator: Scaling decision (target replicas)

        alt Scale Deployment
            Actuator->>K8s: PATCH autoscaling/v1/Scale<br/>(Deployment subresource)
            K8s-->>Actuator: Scale updated
        else Scale LeaderWorkerSet
            Actuator->>K8s: PATCH autoscaling/v1/Scale<br/>(LWS subresource)
            K8s-->>Actuator: Scale updated
        else Scale from Zero
            Actuator->>K8s: Dynamic client discovery<br/>+ PATCH Scale subresource
            K8s-->>Actuator: Workload scaled from zero
        end
    end

    Note over CMCtrl,DS: Runtime Config Update
    CM->>CMCtrl: ConfigMap updated (live)
    CMCtrl->>DS: Update parameters (no restart)
